{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20797","headline":"孟夫子生生亭赋 · 卢仝","name":"孟夫子生生亭赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉川子沿孟冬之寒流兮，辍櫂上登生生亭。\n夫子何之兮，面逐云没兮南行。\n百川注海而心不写兮，落日千里凝寒精。\n予日衰期人生之世斯已矣，爰爲今日犹犹岐路之心生。\n悲夫！南国风涛，鱼龙畜伏。\n予小子戆朴，必不能济夫子欲。\n嗟自慙承夫子而不失予兮，传古道甚分明。\n予且广孤目遐賷于天壤兮，庶得外尽万物变化之幽情。\n然後慙愧而来归兮，大息吾躬于夫子之亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}